<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body>
  <section style="width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:auto;color:#444;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;">
    <div style="width:100%;z-index:2;position:relative;">
      <img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/chasscepts/image/upload/v1790659347/solfa-scripts/banners/choir-connect_d9wsac.png" alt="!" style="width:100%;height:auto;" />
    </div>
    <div style="width:100%;text-align:center;background-color:#eff4fd;color:#0B3D91;">
      <h1 style="font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;margin:0;padding:16px;">
        {{subject}}
      </h1>
    </div>
    <p style="padding:0;margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#222;">
      <span>Hi</span>
      <span>{{name}},</span>
    </p>
    <p>Welcome to Solfa Scripts! Please confirm your email address to activate your account and keep it secure.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" style="display: block; width: 100%; background-color: #0B3D91; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 12px 0; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">
        Verify your email
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      <span>You can also copy and paste the following code into our&nbsp;</span>
      <a href="{{verificationPage}}" style="color: #0B3D91; text-decoration: underline;">verification page</a>:
      <br />
      <span style="display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:16px;padding: 4px; background-color: #f0f0f0; border-radius: 4px;">
        <strong>{{token}}</strong>
      </span>
    </p>
    <p>This link will expire in 1 hour. If you didn't create a Solfa Scripts account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;color:#222;">
      <div>Regards,</div>
      <div style="font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;">Solfa Scripts Team</div>
    </div>
    <div style="padding:14px 0 22px;color:rgba(15,23,42,.55);font-size:12px; line-height:1.55;background:#ffffff;" bgcolor="#ffffff">
      <div>
        Need help? Contact <a style="color:#0B3D91;" href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}">{{supportEmail}}</a>.
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;">
        © {{year}} {{appName}}. All rights reserved.
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:10px;color:rgba(15,23,42,.58);font-size:12px; line-height:1.6;">
        This message was sent to {{email}} because you initiated an account action on {{appName}}.
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
